    "detailed_description": "Dragon Courier is an open-world RPG, influenced by classic JRPG and CRPG genres.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332040/extras/715162b4795b57a37ee91de9c4aa5e9b.poster.avif?t=1745002117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332040/extras/715162b4795b57a37ee91de9c4aa5e9b.webm?t=1745002117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332040/extras/715162b4795b57a37ee91de9c4aa5e9b.mp4?t=1745002117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>A strong wind blows across the world and refuses to stop. Fearing a bad omen, people grow suspicious of one another as a dark age descends. Increasing corruption and greed lures out evil creatures from the mountain depths, looking to pilfer from vulnerable travelers. As a courier for the Dragon Dispatch, you provide secure delivery of goods. Start with simple tasks and build towards bigger jobs, taking you across the world into the middle of a larger story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Large Open-World Exploration <br></li><li>Strategic Turn-Based Combat<br></li><li>Diverse Quests<br></li><li>Rich Storyline<br></li><li>Dungeon Crawling<br></li><li>Cloud Saving<br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Fishing!</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Dragon Courier is an open-world RPG, influenced by classic JRPG and CRPG genres.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332040/extras/715162b4795b57a37ee91de9c4aa5e9b.poster.avif?t=1745002117\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332040/extras/715162b4795b57a37ee91de9c4aa5e9b.webm?t=1745002117\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332040/extras/715162b4795b57a37ee91de9c4aa5e9b.mp4?t=1745002117\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2>A strong wind blows across the world and refuses to stop. Fearing a bad omen, people grow suspicious of one another as a dark age descends. Increasing corruption and greed lures out evil creatures from the mountain depths, looking to pilfer from vulnerable travelers. As a courier for the Dragon Dispatch, you provide secure delivery of goods. Start with simple tasks and build towards bigger jobs, taking you across the world into the middle of a larger story.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Large Open-World Exploration <br></li><li>Strategic Turn-Based Combat<br></li><li>Diverse Quests<br></li><li>Rich Storyline<br></li><li>Dungeon Crawling<br></li><li>Cloud Saving<br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Fishing!</li></ul>",
